{
  "name": "agent402",
  "version": "2.15.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Agent402 is the payment and trust layer for agentic commerce: agents find, pay for and verify paid calls to Agent402, across x402 and MPP, with signed receipts on successful direct calls. Agent402.Tools is the open-source, self-hostable x402 + MCP server: 500+ ready tools and 80+ skill packs on the same rails, a crawled index and router for outside x402 sellers, plus a pay-per-crawl tollbooth. Run free, or charge per call over x402 (USDC on Base, Solana, Polygon, Arbitrum, Monad, Celo, Avalanche, Sei, Optimism, Arc, Ink, Stellar & Algorand - plus USDG on Robinhood Chain). 14 chains supported.",
